## Results & Reports

After pipeline completes, check:
- **Report**: `results\pipeline_YYYYMMDD_HHMMSS\pipeline_report.md` — executive summary
- **Metrics**: `results\pipeline_YYYYMMDD_HHMMSS\wfo_results.csv` — per-fold details  
- **Status log**: `results\pipeline_YYYYMMDD_HHMMSS\status.txt` — execution timeline with ETA

