## Troubleshooting

| Symptom | Cause | Fix |
|---------|-------|-----|
| `No module named 'ggTrader'` | Using bare `python` instead of venv | Use `.\.venv\Scripts\python.exe` |
| Pipeline hangs at buffer fill (0% CPU) | Missing `PYTHONUNBUFFERED` or not using `-u` flag | Set `$env:PYTHONUNBUFFERED = "1"` and use `-u` |
| `The term 'head' is not recognized` | Using Unix command in PowerShell | Use `Select-Object -First N` instead |
| `&& or ` is invalid` | Using bash operators in PowerShell | Use `;` for sequential commands |
| Path not found | Unquoted path with spaces | Quote all paths: `"C:\path\with spaces\file.txt"` |
| Process exits immediately (no output) | Script error, check with direct run | Run without background redirection to see error |
